---
description: Project entry point for the British Manifesto Archive
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` at the repo root first, then `knowledge/index.md` and
`backlog/tasks/`. Record durable facts in `knowledge/` and task progress in the
relevant `backlog/tasks/` file. This repo is the single source of truth.

Hard conventions often missed:
- Manifesto covers → `knowledge/pipelines/covers.md` (transparent A4 PNG)
- Period party names → `knowledge/data-model/party-names.md`
- Cache-bust `?v=` / `ASSETS_VERSION` when changing JS/CSS/covers
